"P1119411519" "(Fireball blazes in your presence)<br><br>Hey, buddy, you think you can help us out? Us Animus Arcana are spells that can think and talk, you know. We are, as you put it, intelligent. But there is a stage before we can communicate, and the thaumaturgists call it 'sentient.' We Intelligent spells look out for promising Sentient ones to help along and ensure they become Intelligent like us. In a warehouse full of Drudges, we have word of four spells being kept as pets. We'd love it if you could go in there and collect them and bring them back to us."
// AcceptString :
"P511845218" "Collect Sentient Spells"
// SendOffString :
"P1046791847" "(Fireball blazes in glee)<br><br>Great! Fantastic! You should know that these Sentient spells really are no smarter than animals, almost pet-like in their actions, so make sure you don't spook them and let them get accustomed to you before you do anything radical."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3510573822" "Collect Sentient spells"
