"P2179012743" "Sir Sedrick"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2994285188" "This has to be special, I mean, look at it."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4219257811" "The Council must have sent you!'"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2141576820" "If it is what I think it is, the Arcane Council will be looking for it."
// Script Variable WaveShout :
"P1936714319" "<shout>Stop {HeroName}!"
