// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2532295516" "Did I ever tell you what a Fracture is? It exists outside the normal life cycle of an Animus, and only the most powerful of spells can attain it. Destroying a Fracture is one of the more difficult things you can do, because Fractures don't come back as Zygotes, they are just... gone. Whispers have it that their magical energy is absorbed by nearby spells not reborn as Zygotes. That makes sense, I guess. Anyway, there is a Fracture calling himself {BossName} that is going around acting like he's all that and a bag of chips. He's getting a few Intelligent spells to back him up as well, hoping that they too can become Fractures and be all-powerful. We need you to go in and take {BossName} out for good. Fractures are dangerous and too many of them can cause a magical imbalance that the Animus can't recover from."
// AcceptString :
"P2003052377" "Destroy {BossName}"
// SendOffString :
"P674654666" "Great to hear it. {BossName} is attracting more Animus to his cause every day, so the sooner you deal with him the better."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4013195173" "Take out {BossName}."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2806314786" "Still need {BossName} dealt with. What are you standing here for?"
// TaskTitle :
"P2469500789" "<color deepskyblue>Gate Crasher</color>"

