"P1492290401" "Ah great, you're willing to do more for us. You know those Animus Arcana that are like floating magic items? Those are called Embodiments, they are Intelligent spells that have found permanent homes within items of power. We on the Arcane Council generally oversee the transitions into Embodiments, but we require specific, unenchanted, items for the transition."
