// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1464679726" "Oh, {HeroName}, I was expecting you."
// Answer Text :
"P1514149492" "What happened to the Zygotes?"
// Answer Text :
"P1545339854" "Do you know what spell was cast that did this?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3546615741" "I saw all the Zygotes in Night Ward taken away and return nearly instantly, but they were no longer Zygotes. They were Coalesced spells. A Coalesced spell is what a Zygote becomes after it has been used in enough magic."
// Answer Text :
"P2669594934" "So EVERY Zygote in Night Ward was used to fuel a single spell that was so powerful it promoted all of them?!"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P920196342" "Yes, that is what it looks like."
// Answer Text :
"P3519226759" "What kind of spell could do this?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3705603328" "We know that the spell couldn't have been cast on this plane of existance. A spell that powerful would be noticed by everyone. I can discern what plane of existance it occurred on, if you which to take a portal to that plane we can learn exactly what happened, and if it can happen again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P668617525" "Who... are you? No one could have survived!"
// Answer Text :
"P3142347884" "My name is {HeroName}, who are you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2998010256" "I'll ask the questions around here. What happened here?"
// Answer Text :
"P1379336176" "First off, who are YOU?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3881829150" "Call me... um, Elmo. How did you survive? I killed everyone!"
// Answer Text :
"P3763373237" "You didn't kill me. Now tell me what happened here."
// Answer Text :
"P926072913" "I am from another dimension. We know something happened here, I was sent to investigate."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1614906219" "I had enough. No one believed I had the power to do what I threatened. No one would give into my demands, so I showed them. I cast a spell to destroy the world, just like I threatened I would."
// Answer Text :
"P3151538592" "You destroyed the entire world?!"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P173952256" "Killed everyone and destroyed everything. Only I was left alone. Now I am the Last Man on Earth, and I intend to keep it that way!"
// Answer Text :
"P2950147091" "Let's do this then."

