// Clue Name :
"P694850400" "Cee Baller's Story"
// DetailString :
"P769838621" "Cee Baller told you that someone in another dimension cast a spell so powerful it consumed every Zygote in Night Ward and turned them all into Coalesced spells. He figured out what plane it occurred on and would like you to investigate and see if it can happen again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2724017922" "Ok, something weird happened earlier. All the Zygotes turned to Coalesced spells nearly instantly. Someone, somewhere, cast a huge spell. An epic spell. An apocaLYPTIC spell. Took all of the Zygotes from Night Ward, and when they were back they were all Coalesced spells, they all gained power during a single spell cast. We need to find out what's going on and if it is going to happen again."
// AcceptString :
"P280053428" "I will pursue this."
// SendOffString :
"P229700418" "Talk to Cee Baller. He usually can divine these sorts of things."
// TaskTitle :
